    "id": "arcassystems/founderos/brain-pass",
    "name": "brain-pass",
    "description": "Synthesise an answer across the brain layer. Say \"what did I decide about X\", \"what have I been avoiding\", \"what do I know about Y\", \"give me the brain on this\" (or run `/founder-os:brain-pass \"<question>\"`). Use when a question needs reasoning across log, knowledge, decisions, flags, patterns, and needs-input - not a raw text match. The skill preflights through `scripts/query.py` to pick the candidate files, then synthesises across them. The model running this skill IS the retrieval engine. No embeddings, no API call, no paid tier required.\n",
